# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build outputs that duplicate the repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each handoff archive contains a full second copy of everything below.
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party code that is not ours to redistribute
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The previous CMS vendor's front-end runtime (SGEN/SGB), captured by the crawl.
# Verified unreferenced: nothing in dist/, src/, tools/ or docs/ loads any of it,
# and the rebuild does not read it. The client licensed the USE of that platform,
# not the right to republish its source.
assets/js/
audit/css/

# Google Fonts binaries harvested during the crawl. Also verified unreferenced:
# the built site loads its faces from fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com,
# so these 4.8 MB are dead weight, and redistributing them without the OFL text
# would be wrong anyway.
assets/fonts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser-collected measurement payloads from the build session. Nothing reads
# them; the reports that matter live in audit/ proper.
audit/collected/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.tmp/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored — these look ignorable and are not
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dist/          the deliverable, and what GitHub Pages serves
# audit/raw/     a BUILD INPUT, not just evidence: build.mjs extracts each
#                page's sections from it. Without it the build emits 0 pages.
# assets/source/ the 169 image masters the build reads via the inventory.

# Pages staging (regenerated by tools/build-pages.mjs)
.pages-build/
.pages-serve/
